---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /work-with-us/contact/
title: "Contact us"
description: "Request a project from the Snider Consulting Group: tell us about your organization, what you need and your timeline."
bodyClass: page-contact
---
{#- Work With Us → Contact us. Intro and "What happens next" come from the old Contact Us and
    Services pages (site.json → contact). Left: a short intro, "The form asks for:" checklist
    (contact.form_asks), the "Request a project form" button (site.json → forms.client_request_form_url, the Google Form,
    opens in a new tab), a "Prefer email?" line (the shared club address) and "What happens
    next". Right: the shared club email, social links and a photo. Then the FAQ's client
    questions (clientFaq: drafts and open decisions excluded). -#}
{%- from "components/page-banner.njk" import pageBanner with context -%}
{%- from "components/wwu-icons.njk" import wwuIcon with context -%}
{%- set c = site.contact -%}
{%- set email = site.forms.client_request_fallback_email if site.forms else null -%}
{%- set formUrl = site.forms.client_request_form_url if site.forms else null -%}
{%- set photo = photos | findBy("id", c.photo) -%}
{%- set photoImg = generatedImages.photos[c.photo] if generatedImages.photos else null -%}

{{ pageBanner({ id: "page-title", title: "Contact us", lede: c.intro,
  before: '<nav class="breadcrumbs page-banner__crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><ol><li><a href="/work-with-us/">Work With Us</a></li><li aria-current="page">Contact us</li></ol></nav>' }) }}

<section class="section" aria-label="Request a project">
  <div class="container contact-layout">
    <div class="contact-layout__main request">
      <h2 class="section__title contact-layout__title">Request a project</h2>
      {%- if formUrl %}
      {%- if c.form_intro %}<p class="request__intro">{{ c.form_intro }}</p>{% endif %}
      {%- if c.form_asks and c.form_asks.length %}
      <p class="request__label" id="form-asks-label">The form asks for:</p>
      <ul class="request__check" aria-labelledby="form-asks-label">
        {%- for item in c.form_asks %}<li>{{ wwuIcon("check", 18) }}<span>{{ item }}</span></li>{% endfor %}
      </ul>
      {%- endif %}
      <p class="request__actions"><a class="btn btn--primary" href="{{ formUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Request a project form<span class="visually-hidden"> (opens in a new tab)</span>{{ wwuIcon("external", 18) }}</a></p>
      {%- if email %}<p class="request__email">Prefer email? Write to <a href="mailto:{{ email }}?subject=Project%20request">{{ email }}</a>.</p>{% endif %}
      {%- elif email %}
      <p class="request__intro">Email us at <a href="mailto:{{ email }}?subject=Project%20request">{{ email }}</a> with your organization, what you need help with and your timeline.</p>
      {%- else %}
      <p class="request__intro">To request a project, message SCG on <a href="{{ site.links.instagram }}" rel="noopener">Instagram</a> or <a href="{{ site.links.linkedin }}" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a>.</p>
      {%- endif %}
      {%- if c.next %}
      <h3 class="request__sub">What happens next</h3>
      <p class="request__next">{{ c.next }}</p>
      {%- endif %}
    </div>
    <aside class="contact-card" aria-labelledby="contact-card-title">
      <h2 class="contact-card__title" id="contact-card-title">Get in touch</h2>
      <ul class="contact-card__list">
        {%- if email %}<li><span class="icon-chip">{{ wwuIcon("mail", 20) }}</span><span><span class="contact-card__label">Email</span><a href="mailto:{{ email }}?subject=Project%20request">{{ email }}</a></span></li>{% endif %}
        <li><span class="icon-chip">{{ wwuIcon("instagram", 20) }}</span><span><span class="contact-card__label">Instagram</span><a href="{{ site.links.instagram }}" rel="noopener">@scgumd</a></span></li>
        <li><span class="icon-chip">{{ wwuIcon("linkedin", 20) }}</span><span><span class="contact-card__label">LinkedIn</span><a href="{{ site.links.linkedin }}" rel="noopener">Snider Consulting Group</a></span></li>
      </ul>
      {%- if photo and photoImg %}
      <picture class="contact-card__photo">
        <source type="image/webp" srcset="{{ photoImg.webpSrcset }}" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 400px, 92vw">
        <img src="{{ photoImg.src }}" srcset="{{ photoImg.jpgSrcset }}" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 400px, 92vw" width="{{ photoImg.width }}" height="{{ photoImg.height }}" alt="{{ photo.alt }}" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
      </picture>
      {%- endif %}
    </aside>
  </div>
</section>

{%- if clientFaq.length %}
<section class="section section--paper-2" aria-labelledby="client-faq-title">
  <div class="container narrow">
    <header class="section__head">
      <p class="eyebrow">FAQ</p>
      <h2 class="section__title" id="client-faq-title">Questions from clients</h2>
    </header>
    <div class="accordion">
      {%- for item in clientFaq %}
      <details>
        <summary>{{ item.q }}</summary>
        <div class="accordion__body"><p>{{ item.a }}</p></div>
      </details>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{%- endif %}
